WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.146
Guide one: installing the Faceless

2
00:00:02.146 --> 00:00:04.100
Video Kit. Setup takes about fifteen

3
00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:06.000
minutes, and your AI assistant does

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.399
the work for you.

5
00:00:07.999 --> 00:00:09.675
Right after you buy, this page

6
00:00:09.675 --> 00:00:11.304
opens. The same link is in your

7
00:00:11.304 --> 00:00:13.407
email. First, pick the AI you use.

8
00:00:13.407 --> 00:00:15.193
Claude Desktop is the easiest, and

9
00:00:15.193 --> 00:00:17.130
it works on any Claude plan.

10
00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:19.528
No Claude Desktop app yet?

11
00:00:19.528 --> 00:00:21.491
Get it free first, and sign in.

12
00:00:21.491 --> 00:00:23.454
Then click Download for Claude.

13
00:00:23.454 --> 00:00:24.824
You get one file.

14
00:00:25.424 --> 00:00:27.641
On a Mac, double-click that file.

15
00:00:27.641 --> 00:00:29.269
Claude Desktop opens and shows

16
00:00:29.269 --> 00:00:30.571
Install. Click it.

17
00:00:30.571 --> 00:00:32.416
On Windows, open Claude's Settings

18
00:00:32.416 --> 00:00:34.153
then Extensions, and install the

19
00:00:34.153 --> 00:00:35.496
file from there.

20
00:00:36.096 --> 00:00:37.949
Keep the suggested folder for your

21
00:00:37.949 --> 00:00:39.702
videos, or pick another one.

22
00:00:39.702 --> 00:00:42.224
Avoid iCloud Drive and OneDrive folders.

23
00:00:42.824 --> 00:00:44.611
Then, in the Claude Desktop app

24
00:00:44.611 --> 00:00:46.136
start a new chat and say:

25
00:00:46.136 --> 00:00:48.041
set up my Faceless Video Kit.

26
00:00:48.041 --> 00:00:49.892
Your licence key is already inside

27
00:00:49.892 --> 00:00:50.858
the file.

28
00:00:51.458 --> 00:00:53.096
Using ChatGPT instead?

29
00:00:53.096 --> 00:00:54.578
It needs a paid plan.

30
00:00:54.578 --> 00:00:56.061
Click ChatGPT, download the

31
00:00:56.061 --> 00:00:57.543
installer and run it.

32
00:00:57.543 --> 00:00:59.520
Then follow the steps on the page to

33
00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:00.877
connect ChatGPT.

34
00:01:01.477 --> 00:01:03.630
Your assistant shows you everything

35
00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:06.034
it will install, and asks you once.

36
00:01:06.034 --> 00:01:08.027
Say yes. If your computer shows an

37
00:01:08.027 --> 00:01:09.878
Allow box, click Allow.

38
00:01:10.478 --> 00:01:12.676
When it's done, your Studio opens in

39
00:01:12.676 --> 00:01:14.774
your browser, and an FVK Studio icon

40
00:01:14.774 --> 00:01:16.348
goes on your desktop.

41
00:01:16.348 --> 00:01:18.155
The Set up tab shows a tick for

42
00:01:18.155 --> 00:01:19.296
every step.

43
00:01:19.896 --> 00:01:21.690
Your assistant also asks who makes

44
00:01:21.690 --> 00:01:23.433
your pictures and your voice.

45
00:01:23.433 --> 00:01:25.227
Each service says what it costs, and

46
00:01:25.227 --> 00:01:26.572
keys stay in a file on your

47
00:01:26.572 --> 00:01:28.365
computer. You never paste a key into

48
00:01:28.365 --> 00:01:29.263
the chat.

49
00:01:29.863 --> 00:01:31.324
That's setup done.

50
00:01:31.324 --> 00:01:33.744
Next, a quick tour of your Studio.
